{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣天王周杰倫（周董）身家雄厚不容置疑，近日他於社交帳號限時動態晒出晚餐照，其中4瓶紅酒意外成了焦點，事關經網民仔細翻查後，發現紅酒屬於「天價」，總市值粗略計算高達約48萬港元，意味着他一餐飯等同喝掉一輛靚車，非凡生活引起熱議。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.257858+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T01:01:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"14d7f3e0de85a546e3c4abb633e22db92596b2e58062ae619ba41c6dc24e9b7e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}